  "about": "The tractus of the formulary “Christ the King” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "He shall say to Me, You are My Father, My God, My Rock, My Savior. And I will make Him the firstborn, highest of the kings of the earth. I will make His posterity endure forever and His throne as the days of heaven."
    }
